--- A Postgres server that does not answer stops the program as the
--- connection opens, with the driver's reason, the same in both modes. A
--- compiled program that used Postgres without the web layer had not built:
--- the driver's tokio lacked the features it uses.
use db
pg = connect['postgres://nobody@127.0.0.1:1/none']
log[query[pg, 'SELECT 1 AS one']]
